Cell["\<\
The net takes no input and its output is the state the circuit produces, so \
running it gives the Wigner vector directly - no separate state extraction:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1303163127,ExpressionUUID->"65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],

