  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d1ff276-b82a-c3ca-5b24-f43039dc9110"],
 " port as the objective, and the gate array is what gets updated."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1651187567,ExpressionUUID->"14fd1512-f616-8834-3c82-8d5f83a0db1e"],

